          %h3#Modules
            Modules/Vector spaces over
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi 𝔽
                    %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{F}_1
          %p
            One proposal here is to identify the concept of finite rank
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modules"} modules
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite-dimensional+vector+spaces"} finite-dimensional vector spaces
            over the field with one element with that of (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pointed+set"}> pointed
            )
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+sets"} finite sets
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi 𝔽
                    %mn 1
                  %msub
                    %mi Mod
                    %mi fin
                  %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                  %mo ≃
                  %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                  %msubsup
                    %mi Set
                    %mi fin
                    %mrow
                      %mo *
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                  \\mathbb{F}_1 Mod_{fin}
                  \\;\simeq\;
                  Set^{\ast/}_{fin}
          %p
            and hence the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symmetric+group"} symmetric group
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi Σ
                    %mi n
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Sigma_n
            on
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi n
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elements"} elements
            with the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/general+linear+group"} general linear group
            over
            = succeed ":" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi 𝔽
                      %mn 1
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{F}_1
          .maruku-equation
