          %p
            (e.g.
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#Cohn04"} Cohn 04, “puzzle 1”
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#Durov07"} Durov 07, 2.5.6
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#Snyder07"} Snyder 07
          %p
            But it has also been argued by Connes and Consani (see
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#BeardsleyNakamura24"} Beardsley &amp; Nakamura 24, 2.3
            = succeed "-modules" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
